  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
    "text": "<h3>For all investor relations news please visit the Investor Resources page.<br>\n<br>\n</h3>\n<h4><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/home/default.aspx\">Investor Resources</a></span></h4>\n<h4><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about.html\">About us</a></span></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/our-management.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Leadership</span></a></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/awards.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Awards</span></a></h4>\n<h4><br>\nNews archive</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/news/2015/news-archive.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">2015</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/news/2014/news-archive.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">2014</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/news/2013/news-archive.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">2013</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/news/2012/news-archive.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">2012</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/news/2011/news-archive.html\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">2011</span></a></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4>Media</h4>\n<p>Please direct all media inquiries to:</p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:MediaRelations@stryker.com\"><b>MediaRelations@stryker.com</b></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/covid19.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">COVID-19</span></a></p>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 9000px; top: 0px;\"><p>Please direct all media inquiries to Jo Hawk, Lead Communications and Public Relations Specialist, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jo.hawk@stryker.com\">jo.hawk@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 7256;&nbsp;Jenny Braga, Senior Communications Manager, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jenny.braga@stryker.com\">jenny.braga@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 6493; or Jon Zimmer, Director, Public Relations, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jon.zimmer@stryker.com\">jon.zimmer@stryker.com</a>, 201 749 8822.</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 9000px; top: 0px;\"><h4 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Media</h4>\n<p>Please direct all media inquiries to Jo Hawk, Lead Communications and Public Relations Specialist, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jo.hawk@stryker.com\">jo.hawk@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 7256;&nbsp;Jenny Braga, Senior Communications Manager, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jenny.braga@stryker.com\">jenny.braga@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 6493; or Jon Zimmer, Director, Public Relations, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jon.zimmer@stryker.com\">jon.zimmer@stryker.com</a>, 201 749 8822.</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 9000px; top: 0px;\"><h4>Media</h4>\n<p>Please direct all media inquiries to Jo Hawk, Lead Communications and Public Relations Specialist, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jo.hawk@stryker.com\">jo.hawk@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 7256;&nbsp;Jenny Braga, Senior Communications Manager, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jenny.braga@stryker.com\">jenny.braga@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 6493; or Jon Zimmer, Director, Public Relations, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jon.zimmer@stryker.com\">jon.zimmer@stryker.com</a>, 201 749 8822.</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 9000px; top: 0px;\"><h4>Media</h4>\n<p>Please direct all media inquiries to Jo Hawk, Lead Communications and Public Relations Specialist, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jo.hawk@stryker.com\">jo.hawk@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 7256;&nbsp;Jenny Braga, Senior Communications Manager, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jenny.braga@stryker.com\">jenny.braga@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 6493; or Jon Zimmer, Director, Public Relations, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jon.zimmer@stryker.com\">jon.zimmer@stryker.com</a>, 201 749 8822.</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 9000px; top: 0px;\"><h4>Media</h4>\n<p>Please direct all media inquiries to Jo Hawk, Lead Communications and Public Relations Specialist, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jo.hawk@stryker.com\">jo.hawk@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 7256;&nbsp;Jenny Braga, Senior Communications Manager, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jenny.braga@stryker.com\">jenny.braga@stryker.com</a>, 269 389 6493; or Jon Zimmer, Director, Public Relations, at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:jon.zimmer@stryker.com\">jon.zimmer@stryker.com</a>, 201 749 8822.</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
